This project is a C# binding for Pyxel (https://github.com/kitao/pyxel),
which is licensed under the MIT License:

Copyright (c) 2018-2026 Takashi Kitao

The Pyxel engine itself is included as an unmodified git submodule and is
statically linked into the distributed native library (pyxel_bind_cs.dll).
See pyxel/LICENSE for the full upstream license text.
